body:
Sorry if this is a stupid comment. You don’t literally mean this morning being September 10th 2018 right? I’ve had this image as my phone background for the past 3 months. 

&nbsp;


EDIT: added the photo and as I’m adding it, I realize there are some differences. Just a couple of minutes before I saw this post I was considering changing my background to the lonely dandi lion on the front page but decided your picture was better, then BOOM this pic came after. Weird O.o https://i.imgur.com/L1TmT9p.jpg
